 "name": "Shadow User",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/ten-shadows.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Divine Dogs</em></p>\n<p>You have furthered your use of shadows. Choose one of the following features (This feat can be taken multiple times).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Shadow Skulker</strong>. As an action for 2 CE you physically enter the shadows gaining full cover for a turn or until you exit from a shadow within 10 feet. At the start of your turn, you can spend 1 CE to remain in the shadow. You can hear and see through the shadow and can summon tamed shikigami within the shadow. If the shadow is sufficiently illuminated, you exit the shadow.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Shadow Ridge</strong>. As a reaction for 1 CE against a melee attack, you force a creature within 10 ft to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failure the target rolls the attack at disadvantage as their legs fall into their shadow briefly and they fall prone. You can instead spend 3 CE to give the target disadvantage on the save.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Two shadow spells below 5th level. The CE cost equals the spell’s level.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
   "chat": ""
  },
